# Execute HPCA's native port RCL witness before independently launching HPCLANG.
0 monitor 90000
1000 tap on
2000 chord alpha mode
3000 chord alpha letter_p
4000 chord alpha f3
5000 chord alpha f1
6000 tap enter
7000 capture native-port-recalled
8000 chord alpha mode
9000 chord alpha letter_p
10000 chord alpha f3
11000 chord alpha nxt
12000 chord alpha f1
13000 chord alpha eval
14000 chord alpha files
15000 tap enter
17000 capture recalled-by-name
18000 chord rshift two
20500 tap f1
23000 tap f1
